editor_description = "A swamp forest on the new map (Scenes/Map.tscn): the trees standing in the Swamp's own low country, between its open marsh and its lakes. A Forest, so the party may be set upon in it, at Forest.tscn's odds; this scene sets only its colour, an olive green, see-through over the land."
